  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Uganda?s Capacity for Climate-Resilient Cocoa Value Chain Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the capacity of NaCORI, Zonal Agricultural Research and Development Institutes (ZARDIs) and the private sector to collaboratively carry out applied research and produce enhanced cocoa varieties (high quality planting materials) leading to farm-level adoption that would enable Uganda meet future cocoa demand of 100,000 metric tons per annum by 2030</narrative>
  </description>
